library; BlueZ/system D-Bus remain host services. See helper/Cargo.lock,
helper/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt and helper/README.md for notices and runtime
requirements. Container D-Bus/dbus-python/GLib keep their Debian licenses.

